      "learner": "Learners aged 13–22 in a school or university Spanish course, comfortable with grammar explanations; 3–4 hours a week; may sit DELE A1/A2 or a school exam",
      "goal": "Complete A1 and A2 with full coverage of the grammar and functions, ready for an A2 exam (reading, listening, writing an email, speaking interaction)",
